OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK councillor claims 'grass
OL,4,Adoes not grow'                         
OL,6,FBaker said: "Grass hasn't grown because
OL,7,Fof climate change - why buy new        
OL,8,Fmowers?" and Smith replied: "We still  
OL,9,Fneed to cut grass, it does grow."      
